<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="rss.xsl"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title><description>SONiC NOS（sonic-net/SONiC）の日本語非公式ドキュメント</description><link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link><atom:link href="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <docs>https://github.com/aoki-taquan/sonic-unofficial-docs</docs><language>ja</language> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:06:18 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:06:18 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.19.0</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> </image> <item> <title>変更履歴</title> <category>changelog</category> <category>meta</category> <description>変更履歴 — このページは merged PR のメタデータから meta/scripts/gen_changelog.py で機械生成されています。手で編集しないでください。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/changelog.png" type="image/png" length="19713" /> </item> <item> <title>カバレッジ</title> <description>カバレッジ — このページは docs/**/*.md の frontmatter verification フィールドを集計したものです。meta/scripts/gen_coverage.py で自動生成されます。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/coverage/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/coverage/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/coverage.png" type="image/png" length="23000" /> </item> <item> <title>サイトマップ</title> <category>meta</category> <category>sitemap</category> <description>サイトマップ — docs/**/*.md を mkdocs nav 順で階層列挙したインデックス（全 1098 ページ）。meta/scripts/gen_sitemap.py で自動生成。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/sitemap.png" type="image/png" length="22774" /> </item> <item> <title>スナップショット</title> <description>&lt;h1&gt;スナップショット&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;リポジトリ全体の状態を 1 ページに集約した自動生成サマリ。個別の詳細は &lt;code&gt;coverage.md&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;sitemap.md&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;discrepancies.md&lt;/code&gt; を参照。&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;!!! note &#34;生成元&#34; `python3 meta/scripts/gen_snapsho...&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/snapshot/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/snapshot/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/snapshot.png" type="image/png" length="16430" /> </item> <item> <title>SmartSwitch HA DPU-Scope-DPU-Driven 運用（CLI / 設定 / failover 確認）</title> <description>SmartSwitch HA DPU-Scope-DPU-Driven の設定経路（DASH SDN config）、failover 確認、BFD / next hop / split-brain のトラブルシュート手順、制限事項と干渉機能を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-high-level-design-dpu-scope-dpu-driven-setup-operations/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-high-level-design-dpu-scope-dpu-driven-setup-operations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-high-level-design-dpu-scope-dpu-driven-setup-operations.png" type="image/png" length="52163" /> </item> <item> <title>port_config.ini パーサ統合（portconfig.py 一元化）</title> <description>port_config.ini パーサを sonic-config-engine/portconfig.py に一本化し、散在するパース実装を集約する HLD。platform.json 移行の下地としての位置付けと、build/runtime 依存および test plan を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sonic-port-configuration-refactor-design/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sonic-port-configuration-refactor-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/sonic-port-configuration-refactor-design.png" type="image/png" length="43406" /> </item> <item> <title>SAI 拡張属性追加系</title> <description>SAI 拡張属性追加系 — このカテゴリは、SAI そのものを横断するページを集めます。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/sai-extensions/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/sai-extensions/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/categories/sai-extensions.png" type="image/png" length="17016" /> </item> <item> <title>初学者向けガイド</title> <description>初学者向けガイド — SONiC を初めて触る読者を想定しています。ネットワーク OS としての SONiC の位置付け、コンテナ、Redis DB、SAI、設定反映の流れを把握し、各 area の意味を理解するための導線です。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/beginner/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/beginner/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/beginner.png" type="image/png" length="19506" /> </item> <item> <title>運用者向けガイド</title> <description>運用者向けガイド — 既に SONiC を運用している読者を想定した入口。日々の確認、設定変更、障害調査、CONFIG_DB の意味確認、show techsupport やログ・ヘルスチェックの使い方に加え、症状別の逆引き表をインラインで提供します。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/operator/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/operator/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/operator.png" type="image/png" length="19962" /> </item> <item> <title>gNMI SET / Translib 書き込み有効化</title> <category>build</category> <category>configuration</category> <category>gnmi</category> <category>translib</category> <description>gNMI SET リクエストが失敗する場合の原因と、Translib 書き込みを有効化してビルドする方法を説明する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/gnmi-translib-write-enable/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/gnmi-translib-write-enable/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/gnmi-translib-write-enable.png" type="image/png" length="29662" /> </item> <item> <title>用語集 (Glossary)</title> <description>用語集 (Glossary) — SONiC NOS で頻出する固有用語・略語・コンポーネント名・データベース名・デーモン名を、アルファベット順に整理した日本語用語集です。各エントリは「用語 / 略称 / 日本語訳 / 簡潔な説明 / 関連ページ」の形式で記載しています。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png" type="image/png" length="30026" /> </item> <item> <title>config banner サブコマンド</title> <description>config banner サブコマンド — config banner はシステムバナー（ログイン前/後メッセージ、MOTD）を CONFIG_DB の BANNER_MESSAGE|global テーブルに書き込む CLI グループ。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-banner/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-banner/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/config-banner.png" type="image/png" length="34879" /> </item> <item> <title>Warm Reboot が失敗 / 通信断が長引く</title> <description>Warm Reboot が失敗もしくは通信断が長引くケースの切り分け runbook。WARM_RESTART テーブルの enable 状態、reconciliation の進捗、BGP graceful-restart capability、syncd の pre-shutdown 状態などを順に確認する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/warm-reboot-failure/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/warm-reboot-failure/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/warm-reboot-failure.png" type="image/png" length="40189" /> </item> <item> <title>sonic-scheduler YANG</title> <description>sonic-scheduler YANG — SCHEDULER yang Module for SONiC OS</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-scheduler/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/yang/sonic-scheduler/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/yang/sonic-scheduler.png" type="image/png" length="34435" /> </item> <item> <title>L2 Forwarding 強化（FDB flush / aging / static MAC / VLAN range）</title> <description>SONiC 初期 L2 に欠けていた FDB flush・MAC move・aging 設定・static FDB・VLAN range CLI 等 6 項目を一括導入する HLD。orchagent は実装済みだが一部 CLI は現行 master に存在しない乖離あり。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/layer-2-forwarding-enhancements/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/layer-2-forwarding-enhancements/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/switching/layer-2-forwarding-enhancements.png" type="image/png" length="59815" /> </item> <item> <title>SONiC 全体像と設定基盤</title> <description>SONiC 全体像と設定基盤 — この章は、SONiC を読むときに最初に混乱しやすい「設定はどこから入るのか」「Redis DB は何を分担するのか」「変更はどこまで安全に戻せるのか」を、HLD 単位ではなく読者の質問順に並べ直した入口です。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/01-overview/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/01-overview/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/01-overview/index.png" type="image/png" length="25599" /> </item> <item> <title>設定変更の選び方</title> <description>設定変更の選び方 — SONiC には設定変更の入口が複数あります。選び方の軸は「変更範囲」「停止影響」「検証と rollback が必要か」「永続化するか」です。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/01-overview/configuration/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/01-overview/configuration/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/01-overview/configuration.png" type="image/png" length="16741" /> </item> <item> <title>Build / Packaging / Application Extension</title> <description>Build / Packaging / Application Extension — この章は、SONiC を「どう作って配るか」と「外部アプリケーションをどう持ち込むか」を、開発者と運用者が同じ地図で読むための入口である。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/19-build-packaging/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/19-build-packaging/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/19-build-packaging/index.png" type="image/png" length="46877" /> </item> <item> <title>発展トピック</title> <description>ARM 移植・container hardening・feature quality 定義・マルチプラットフォーム並列ビルド・SDK 切替・再現可能ビルド・CVE 対応など、リリース直前にまとめて満たしておきたい横断観点を並べる章。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/19-build-packaging/advanced/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 06:04:10 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/19-build-packaging/advanced/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/19-build-packaging/advanced.png" type="image/png" length="21064" /> </item> <item> <title>Container / Build system 関連</title> <description>SONiC の container / build / image / upgrade に関わるページを area 横断でまとめたカテゴリ索引。sonic-buildimage の多段ビルド構造・container hardening・secure upgrade・warm restart など 14 ページを扱う。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/container-build/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 05:31:23 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/container-build/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/categories/container-build.png" type="image/png" length="42711" /> </item> </channel> </rss>